WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.273
Today we will connect the form of a useful object to its function. Our work connects

00:00:05.273 --> 00:00:07.176
with Ghanaian and other African artists.

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:11.233
Observe the pot rim, body, base and any decoration.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:17.062
Draw the outline using simple curved lines. Record why your chosen technique suits

00:00:17.062 --> 00:00:17.836
the message.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.132
Add a label showing how the pot might be used.
